Total Sum $= (N-1)! \sum_{v=1}^N \sum_{k=0}^{N-1} \frac{v}{\binom{N-1}{k}} \sum_{S \subset \{1,\dots,N\}\setminus\{v\}, |S|=k} 10^{\sum_{x \in S} L_x}$.

